  - "A FOLY\xD3 MORAJ\xC1T, A H\xD3 ROPOG\xC1S\xC1T, A GY\xD6NY\xD6R\u0170 NAPFELKELT\xC9T..."
  - "AH, NEM MUSZ\xC1J V\xC9GIGHALLGATNOD A MORFOND\xCDROZ\xC1SOMAT, MISI."
  - "M\xC1R EL\u0150TT\xDCNK A C\xC9L! KIR\xC1LYS\xC1G, ITT J\xD6V\xDCNK!"
